X:1
T: Immortal, Invisible, God Only Wise
C: Words: Walter Chalmers Smith, 1876.
C: Music: 'St. Denio' or 'Joanna' or 'Palestrina'
C: traditional Welsh found in "Caniadau y Cyssegr" by John Roberts, 1839.
C: Setting: "Caniadau y Cyssegr a'r Teulu", 1878, alt.
C: copyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2005 Revision.
S: Music source: Episcopal Hymnal, 1940, Hymn 301.  Also in English Hymnal, 1906 Hymn 407 (page missing in my copy).
S: Setting from "Caniadau y Cyssegr a'r Teulu", 1878 hymn 442, alt.
